All color contrast ratios meet WCAG AA (4.5:1 for normal text)
All images have meaningful alt text
Form has proper labels and focus indicators
Keyboard navigation works smoothly
Screen readers can access all content
No automated accessibility errors in Axe/WAVE
Website passes Lighthouse accessibility audit

